<div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p role="heading" aria-level="4" style="margin: 21.2667px 0px; font-style: italic;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Recruitment</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Before</span><span style="margin: 0px"> we begin, </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> first step is </span><span style="margin: 0px">recruiting</span><span style="margin: 0px"> project </span><span style="margin: 0px">participants</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">insofar</span><span style="margin: 0px"> as</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> full team has </span><span style="margin: 0px">not</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">yet</span><span style="margin: 0px"> been </span><span style="margin: 0px">formed</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">during</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">foundational</span><span style="margin: 0px"> or design </span><span style="margin: 0px">phase</span><span style="margin: 0px">.&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">You</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">can</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">recruit</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">based</span><span style="margin: 0px"> on background (disciplines), </span><span style="margin: 0px">motivation</span><span style="margin: 0px">, or </span><span style="margin: 0px">grades</span><span style="margin: 0px"> (in </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> case of </span><span style="margin: 0px">students</span><span style="margin: 0px">). </span><span style="margin: 0px">Motivation</span><span style="margin: 0px"> is </span><span style="margin: 0px">an</span><span style="margin: 0px"> important </span><span style="margin: 0px">criterion</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">based</span><span style="margin: 0px"> on </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> idea that every voice </span><span style="margin: 0px">holds</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">value</span><span style="margin: 0px"> in </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">knowledge</span><span style="margin: 0px">, and </span><span style="margin: 0px">therefore</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">every</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">motivated</span><span style="margin: 0px"> participant </span><span style="margin: 0px">should</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">be</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">given</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> opportunity </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> take part in </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> education.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p role="heading" aria-level="4" style="margin: 21.2667px 0px; font-style: italic;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Safe Learning Environment</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">When we </span><span style="margin: 0px">actually come</span><span style="margin: 0px"> together, you truly feel the journey progressing—an exciting reality.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">According to the </span><span style="margin: 0px">core</span><span style="margin: 0px"> values of </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinarity</span><span style="margin: 0px">, we must ensure </span><span style="margin: 0px">mutual</span><span style="margin: 0px"> trust and freedom for everyone. Creating a safe </span><span style="margin: 0px">learning</span><span style="margin: 0px"> environment is </span><span style="margin: 0px">essential</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">for</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">successful</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">collaboration</span><span style="margin: 0px"> (</span><span style="margin: 0px">i.e.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> Yeung et al., 2021).</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;On </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> next page below, </span><span style="margin: 0px">lessons</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">from</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">TRAIL research</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Practical Guide </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Collaboration</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px"> (Het Groene Brein, 2023) </span><span style="margin: 0px">will</span><span style="margin: 0px"> help </span><span style="margin: 0px">you</span><span style="margin: 0px"> get </span><span style="margin: 0px">started</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p role="heading" aria-level="3" style="margin: 18.7333px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">Co-</span><span style="margin: 0px">creation</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">After the start, </span><span style="margin: 0px">you’ll</span><span style="margin: 0px"> quickly discover the challenges in the practical organization of collaboration.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">The </span><span style="margin: 0px">p</span><span style="margin: 0px">resence</span><span style="margin: 0px"> of </span><span style="margin: 0px">many</span><span style="margin: 0px"> different team members </span><span style="margin: 0px">also</span><span style="margin: 0px"> means </span><span style="margin: 0px">many</span><span style="margin: 0px"> different </span><span style="margin: 0px">agendas</span><span style="margin: 0px">, meetings, </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">p</span><span style="margin: 0px">references</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">t</span><span style="margin: 0px">o</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">c</span><span style="margin: 0px">onsider</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">To</span><span style="margin: 0px"> keep </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">collaboration</span><span style="margin: 0px"> on track </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">maintain</span><span style="margin: 0px"> momentum, </span><span style="margin: 0px">various</span><span style="margin: 0px"> tools are </span><span style="margin: 0px">available</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">No </span><span style="margin: 0px">one</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">said</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">it</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">would</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">be</span><span style="margin: 0px"> easy—but </span><span style="margin: 0px">that’s</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">exactly</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">why</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">we’re</span><span style="margin: 0px"> entering </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> most </span><span style="margin: 0px">exciting</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">phase</span><span style="margin: 0px"> of </span><span style="margin: 0px">this</span><span style="margin: 0px"> adventure.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">More </span><span style="margin: 0px">theoretical</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">insights</span><span style="margin: 0px"> on </span><span style="margin: 0px">this</span><span style="margin: 0px"> topic </span><span style="margin: 0px">will</span><span style="margin: 0px"> follow.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px">Sign</span><span style="margin: 0px"> up </span><span style="margin: 0px">for</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">newsletter</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">stay</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">informed</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">about</span><span style="margin: 0px"> content updates!</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-fam